### 0. Login as admin (must already exist with role ADMIN from Day 4 setup)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com",
  "password": "abc12345"
}

###

### Seed: a few events across two categories
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Meetup",
  "description": "Backend meetup",
  "category": "Tech",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
  "venue": "KL Convention Centre",
  "capacity": 50,
  "price": 0
}

###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "React Conference",
  "description": "Frontend conference",
  "category": "Tech",
  "eventDate": "2026-10-01T09:00:00",
  "venue": "Sunway",
  "capacity": 200,
  "price": 150
}

###

POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Jazz Night",
  "description": "Live music evening",
  "category": "Music",
  "eventDate": "2026-09-20T20:00:00",
  "venue": "No Black Tie",
  "capacity": 80,
  "price": 60
}

###

### 1. No filters -> all events, default sort by eventDate asc, page 0 size 10
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 2. Filter by category=Tech -> 2 results (Spring Boot Meetup, React Conference)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?category=Tech
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 3. Keyword search "conference" -> 1 result
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?keyword=conference
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 4. Category + keyword combined -> 1 result (Tech + "react")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?category=Tech&keyword=react
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 5. Sort by price descending -> React Conference (150) first
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?sortBy=price&direction=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 6. Pagination: size=1 page=0 -> 1 result, totalElements=3, totalPages=3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?size=1&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}

###

### 7. Pagination: page beyond range -> empty content, totals still populated
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events?size=1&page=99
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.token}}